WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.200
We are no one.

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.900
We are everyone.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.740
And we are invisible.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.880
We convinced ourselves that they were gone,

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.080
but they were just hibernating.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.300
They came for everybody.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.980
All police.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:33.440
Are we safe?

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.560
I guess we have ourselves a reckoning.

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:02.220
What are you two talking about?

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.300
Oh nothing.

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.680
Just the end of the world.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:07.220
Ticktock, ticktock, ...

